<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107331" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερβῐβ-άζω</span></b> , Causal of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερβαίνω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carry over, transport,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.36.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Music,
				<i>transpose higher,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβιβάζω,</span> Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.91
			</span></i> H. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>transpose</i> the letters of a word, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Vit.Hom.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				342.6
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			); <i>transpose</i> words, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				22.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>in Tht.</u>
				51.40
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ Ἀλέξανδρος ὑπερβιβάζειν
				μᾶλλον ἀξιοῖ τὴν λέξιν</span> prefers to
			<i>explain</i> the phrase <i>as a hyperbaton,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				352.3
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
